    "inspectedOn": "2026-10-17",
    "scope": "Four actually inspected2014/2017 overall,facade,entry and minaret-head pictures plus standard viewer PMTiles/DEM. Untagged profiles,unseen roofs/current finish and precise podium/terrain joins unverified. No bespoke surveys or redistributed photographs.",
    "pictures": [
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kul-Sharfif_Mosque_Kazan_overview.jpg",
        "date": "2014-09-23",
        "author": "Yulesha",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-3.0",
        "observed": "Four tall slender white minarets/blue spires,two shorter white turrets with blue caps,central blue dome with white pointed petal collar,tall paired lancet glazing and folded blue roof. Two-storey rounded podium has smaller dark rectangular windows. Detached blue pavilion,curved approach and Kremlin ranges are neighbouring context."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Front_view_of_Kul_Sharif_Mosque_Kazan_Tartarstan_Russia_(14422822426).jpg",
        "date": "2014-06-17",
        "author": "amanderson2",
        "license": "CC-BY-2.0",
        "observed": "Low-angle daytime view shows paired tall pointed glazed fields framed in pale stone,white pointed gables,blue roof folds,petal collar and blue central dome. Tall minarets have faceted/fluted shafts,projecting gallery rings and narrow blue conical spires/finials. Lower rounded bays have two rows of small dark windows."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Minaret_of_Qol_Sharif_mosque.jpg",
        "date": "2014-08-10",
        "author": "Rafael Mukhametdinov",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "observed": "Night detail clarifies upper minaret heads:pointed white gallery apertures and diamond-like panels under a broad flared blue eave,short blue lantern collar,faceted tapered spire and gold finial/crescent. Warm dark inner surfaces are visible through the head openings. Moon and illumination are not baked into materials."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kazan_Kremlin._Qolşärif_Mosque_P8111900_2900.jpg",
        "date": "2017-08-11",
        "author": "Alexxx1979",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "observed": "Opposite daylight view shows the projecting upper entry portico with pointed arch and paired gold pinnacles,large lancet glazing,white/blue folded upper profile,two shorter turrets and four tall minarets. Forecourt ramps/railings,people,lighting and exact podium approaches are separate context or uncertain."
      }
    ]
